# Rent Is Due: "creatures and/or Treasures" - a Treasure counts beside a creature. Bot1 casts Rent Is Due (paid by Mox Pearl) and Seize the
# Spoils (discarding a Plains) on turn 1, making a Treasure; with the Ornithopter it taps the Treasure and the creature at the end step, draws
# a card, and keeps the enchantment.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Seize the Spoils
Plains
Rent Is Due
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Seize the Spoils.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rent Is Due.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Rent Is Due.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Tapped = true
Stack.Count = 0
